{"title":"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1.1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1.1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solutions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What are all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/997c2bcf4e693ed9d85ba2617b7af6f69de3d281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)(x - 2) = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52532c0b545fb948c4a98ae1d836e65bb78d34f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)(x - 2) = x^{2} - 3x - 2x - 3 \\times -2 = x^{2} - 5x + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"431\" height=\"21\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/7/997c2bcf4e693ed9d85ba2617b7af6f69de3d281.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 3)(x - 2) = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f074c5df51da6fb85b10ade756f39f71373672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 5x + 6 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/84254b1b1d2937e89563337e0071c6e16ca8e072.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 5x = 6 - 6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"159\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb64a1100af5d40db7dc0eb9087cc0a0715d8b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x - 5) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/7/69709428d6a279cb8f85c6506ac7f1fab3f36ced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 5$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> to multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, at least one must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This means we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50034221c2c658c2eac5bd3243d26665a878553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> -&gt; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/e/09efd8141d44b39356799e5c645ef64530cfb47d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc2c1c01b0984c42d43fc6a1d3651192b750d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/4/4c4088310ff3dd87f9c1b3000f94a5b24f95ed28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.1\">Solution 1.1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in solution 1, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/8/a3860c0c9e9da7f2b91b9fff974d9250b2be3a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} - 5x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. Using the qudratic formula, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0351f3dd31b2f0cc6c9118bacad803d754d91a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{-(-5) \\pm \\sqrt{5^{2} - 4 \\times 1 \\times 0}}{2 \\times 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"240\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c13c14e24a5cbd351a52eeb13e200c15ebcb689a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{5 \\pm \\sqrt{5^{2} - 0}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b646ec1421053c25d73df45526096cc2b6ab1991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{5 \\pm \\sqrt{5^{2}}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a31e0d34f8b15cde0d8b251b3fa54ccae5df2db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{5 \\pm 5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>We then have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/a/b5a396dcdcb8ecd8fde165be374b029aa100bc30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{5 + 5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b8b7f342f03c5b3105ded74241dc0070c29f0d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{5 - 5}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />. In the first case, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/4/4c4088310ff3dd87f9c1b3000f94a5b24f95ed28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />. In the second case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/a/ada6c233c82ad86c6f9a94d13179aa766e42989a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 5 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc2c1c01b0984c42d43fc6a1d3651192b750d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By inspection from the original equation, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/297a7d4d0705e78b358ffde9e4ac001529814122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 3 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3c89bd5b2cb3e812c596f84a387befc752cd5e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> works, as well as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a31ce9ce2da3fb8f0acfebdbdd9d0cb24b4727f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 3 = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/2052ce4e1be969eebdeedf5cb1aa99ee975de490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2 = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />, as the numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> apart and multiply to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/4/4c4088310ff3dd87f9c1b3000f94a5b24f95ed28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc2c1c01b0984c42d43fc6a1d3651192b750d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solutions\">Verifying Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that there must be at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> real solutions because the left-hand side is a quadratic, while the right hand side is just a constant term.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, which was one of our solutions, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/b/12b1d71ee966d31c9b04ddd1419549e56674d787.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0 - 3)(0 - 2) = -3 \\times -2 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This matches up with what we should get, so we can now try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffa0492918a709b4d943ea05c3706dfcc1e0bae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 - 3)(5 - 2) = 2 \\times 3 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"209\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This matches up with what we should get, so both of our solutions work.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 204/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7202/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.443      1 2016_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%   11.443      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35966:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001932 and revision id 286176. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}